    {
      "id": "sec_s3l7_concept",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 3 • LESSON 7</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Lafz 'Kull' ka Istemal: كُلٌّ ← كُلُّ كِتَابٍ ، عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ (Page 98)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">كُلٌّ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Kull + Mudaaf Ilaih</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">كُلُّ كِتَابٍ ، كُلُّ نَفْسٍ ، عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• كُلٌّ (Har / Sab) se كُلُّ كِتَابٍ ، كُلُّ نَفْسٍ ، عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ (Har kitaab, har jaan, har cheez par) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Sifat-Mawsoof, Izaafat, Asmaa-ul-Faa'il aur Tasniyah Qur'ani tarakeeb ki buniyaad hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Page 98):** Arbi mein **`كُلٌّ`** ka matlab **'Har' (Every) ya 'Sab' (All)** hota hai. `كُلُّ` ke baad aane wale ism ke neeche hamesha Zair (`ـٍ / ـِ`) aati hai (`كُلُّ نَفْسٍ ذَائِقَةُ الْمَوْتِ` har jaan maut ka maza chakhne wali hai). Aur jab `كُلُّ` se pehle Harf-e-Jarr aaye toh `كُلِّ` ban jata hai (`عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيرٌ`).",
        "content": "<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 3 • LESSON 7</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Lafz 'Kull' ka Istemal: كُلٌّ ← كُلُّ كِتَابٍ ، عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ (Page 98)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">كُلٌّ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Kull + Mudaaf Ilaih</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">كُلُّ كِتَابٍ ، كُلُّ نَفْسٍ ، عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• كُلٌّ (Har / Sab) se كُلُّ كِتَابٍ ، كُلُّ نَفْسٍ ، عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ (Har kitaab, har jaan, har cheez par) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Sifat-Mawsoof, Izaafat, Asmaa-ul-Faa'il aur Tasniyah Qur'ani tarakeeb ki buniyaad hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Page 98):** Arbi mein **`كُلٌّ`** ka matlab **'Har' (Every) ya 'Sab' (All)** hota hai. `كُلُّ` ke baad aane wale ism ke neeche hamesha Zair (`ـٍ / ـِ`) aati hai (`كُلُّ نَفْسٍ ذَائِقَةُ الْمَوْتِ` har jaan maut ka maza chakhne wali hai). Aur jab `كُلُّ` se pehle Harf-e-Jarr aaye toh `كُلِّ` ban jata hai (`عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيرٌ`).",
        "hinglish_text": "<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 3 • LESSON 7</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Lafz 'Kull' ka Istemal: كُلٌّ ← كُلُّ كِتَابٍ ، عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ (Page 98)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">كُلٌّ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Kull + Mudaaf Ilaih</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">كُلُّ كِتَابٍ ، كُلُّ نَفْسٍ ، عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• كُلٌّ (Har / Sab) se كُلُّ كِتَابٍ ، كُلُّ نَفْسٍ ، عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ (Har kitaab, har jaan, har cheez par) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Sifat-Mawsoof, Izaafat, Asmaa-ul-Faa'il aur Tasniyah Qur'ani tarakeeb ki buniyaad hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Page 98):** Arbi mein **`كُلٌّ`** ka matlab **'Har' (Every) ya 'Sab' (All)** hota hai. `كُلُّ` ke baad aane wale ism ke neeche hamesha Zair (`ـٍ / ـِ`) aati hai (`كُلُّ نَفْسٍ ذَائِقَةُ الْمَوْتِ` har jaan maut ka maza chakhne wali hai). Aur jab `كُلُّ` se pehle Harf-e-Jarr aaye toh `كُلِّ` ban jata hai (`عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيرٌ`)."
